        {
          "value": "active",
          "label": "Running",
          "stage": "Execute",
          "mcp": "leased",
          "readAs": "leased",
          "acceptedAhead": "The pinned Ploeg does not send it yet; its next release (ploeg-hq/ploeg#131) sends it in place of `leased`. Unfold accepts it now and reads it as `leased` (apps/unfold/src/ploeg.ts `ploegState`)."
